{
  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §2.2.3, [TSON-SCHEMA] §4.2, [TSON-SCHEMA] §5.6"
  description: """
    `order` is the meta layer's record, and the meta layer is imported, so its namespace is this schema's:
